<title>USA: San Marcos, Texas, won by Southwest Securities.</title>
<headline>San Marcos, Texas, won by Southwest Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities, Inc., said it won $2 million of San Marcos, Texas, waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds, Series 1996-C, with a true interest cost of 5.59 percent.</p>
